    "caption": "🚀 TEKNOFEST Istanbul 2025!\n\nAre you a startup looking for the ultimate platform to showcase your innovation? Do you want to connect with industry leaders, gain global exposure, and compete for over 45 million TRY in prizes and funding? Then TEKNOFEST Istanbul 2025 is your chance to shine! 🌍💡\n\n🔥 Why Apply?\n✅ Access to investment opportunities & industry partnerships\n✅ Compete in technology-driven challenges with real-world impact\n✅ Gain media exposure & networking with top innovators\n✅ Be part of the world’s largest aviation, space & tech festival\n\n💡 Competitions Tailored for Startups:\n🚀 Social Innovation – Transform industries with tech solutions\n🛡 Cybersecurity (Hack Masters) – Defend against digital threats\n🏗 Smart Infrastructure & Robotics – Design the future of automation\n🛸 Flying Car Simulation – Shape next-gen transportation\n🌿 Sustainable Tech & AI – Solve global challenges with cutting-edge ideas\n\n💰 Over 45 MILLION TRY in prizes & support available! \n\n📅  Application deadline: 15 march\n📍 Istanbul\n\n🚀 Follow the link in the bio «Programs» section to apply. Let’s build it together at TEKNOFEST Istanbul 2025!",
